WEBVTT

00:11.544 --> 00:15.139
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.748 --> 00:21.152
Open a window in the morning.

00:21.220 --> 00:27.853
Flowers of light
surround the world.

00:29.228 --> 00:35.098
As if the hidden
feeling in my heart...

00:35.167 --> 00:41.595
...is melting away now.

00:43.175 --> 00:47.908
I'm holding
the fragrance of the season.

00:49.181 --> 00:55.780
I pray to you...

00:55.855 --> 00:58.790
I wanted to meet you...

00:58.858 --> 01:02.555
...ever since the day I was born.

01:02.628 --> 01:05.461
Only you...

01:05.531 --> 01:09.968
...I want to protect only you.

01:10.036 --> 01:12.334
Just you...

01:12.405 --> 01:14.339
...I want to touch.

01:15.708 --> 01:20.645
My hand is going to hold you.

01:22.515 --> 01:24.346
I want to deliver.

01:25.851 --> 01:28.081
Voice of my heart.

02:23.275 --> 02:28.178
Unidentified Living Creature

02:29.348 --> 02:30.838
Cynthia!

02:30.916 --> 02:32.440
That's strange...

02:33.719 --> 02:34.845
Cynthia!

02:37.490 --> 02:38.889
Cynthia-chan!

02:38.958 --> 02:39.925
Cynthia!

02:39.992 --> 02:41.482
Senpai!

02:41.560 --> 02:43.289
Cynthia-senpai!

02:45.531 --> 02:47.624
Cynthia-chan!

02:51.904 --> 02:55.169
The security department
is looking for her too, but...

02:58.811 --> 03:01.712
She hasn't been found yet...

03:01.781 --> 03:04.306
No, nowhere in the mansion.

03:04.383 --> 03:06.510
Other places she might be...

03:06.585 --> 03:08.177
...are nonexistent.

03:27.339 --> 03:29.000
Is everyone all right?

03:29.075 --> 03:30.667
No injuries?

03:30.743 --> 03:32.904
- No...
- I seem to be all...

03:40.519 --> 03:42.646
S-Sorry! I'm sorry!

03:42.721 --> 03:44.552
Pardon me. I apologize!

03:53.899 --> 03:55.890
It's a big hole, isn't it...

03:55.968 --> 03:59.870
The earlier earthquake
seems to be the cause.

03:59.939 --> 04:02.908
It's fortunate there
was no one nearby.

04:02.975 --> 04:05.068
We'll start
the survey right away...

04:05.144 --> 04:08.272
...so please do not
go near it till then.

04:08.948 --> 04:10.279
It's pretty deep...

04:12.852 --> 04:14.251
- Taro-sama?
- Taro-sama!

04:19.525 --> 04:21.083
T-This is...

04:21.160 --> 04:22.718
I am very sorry.

04:22.795 --> 04:25.025
I was not aware of this.

04:26.098 --> 04:28.259
Just as I thought.

04:28.334 --> 04:30.131
It's Cynthia's maid cap, right?

04:32.138 --> 04:34.197
If by any chance, Cynthia is...

04:34.273 --> 04:35.467
Do not worry.

04:35.541 --> 04:38.101
I will personally
lead the survey team.

04:38.177 --> 04:40.737
I will find Cynthia at any cost.

04:40.813 --> 04:42.303
Platoon leader, this...

04:42.381 --> 04:43.507
Konoe-san...

04:44.617 --> 04:45.709
I'm going, too.

04:46.619 --> 04:49.087
Can't you trust us?

04:49.155 --> 04:50.782
I didn't mean that.

04:50.856 --> 04:54.519
I just want to do something
for Cynthia and Grace...

04:54.593 --> 04:55.992
That's all.

04:57.763 --> 04:59.321
I have no choice.

04:59.398 --> 05:00.387
In return...

05:00.466 --> 05:04.232
...even you must follow my
orders once we are underground.

05:04.303 --> 05:06.737
Yeah, thanks, Konoe-san.

05:06.805 --> 05:07.965
Oh?

05:09.041 --> 05:11.339
Have you forgotten about us?

05:11.410 --> 05:12.570
Ryuka-san...

05:12.645 --> 05:13.976
And everyone, too.

05:16.081 --> 05:18.845
Naturally, I will join you.

05:18.918 --> 05:21.011
It really looks fun, doesn't it?

05:21.086 --> 05:23.486
No, not as much as you...

05:25.124 --> 05:28.457
A mysterious underground
labyrinth beneath the mansion...

05:28.527 --> 05:30.995
That's wonderful!

05:31.063 --> 05:32.826
I'll accompany you, too.

05:32.898 --> 05:35.196
We're with you wherever you go!

05:35.901 --> 05:37.493
Everyone...

05:37.570 --> 05:39.868
All right, let's go together!

05:39.939 --> 05:41.770
Yeah!

05:48.380 --> 05:51.679
W-What was that voice?

05:51.750 --> 05:54.184
I-It couldn't be a voice...

05:54.253 --> 05:56.585
Wasn't it just
the sound of the wind?

05:56.655 --> 05:59.681
Y-Yeah, it couldn't be...

05:59.758 --> 06:02.226
- That's right.
- What are you saying?

06:02.294 --> 06:03.522
You scared me.

06:18.143 --> 06:20.475
Who on Earth made this...

06:20.546 --> 06:23.538
And why wasn't it
discovered till now?

06:28.821 --> 06:30.049
- It's dark!
- It's narrow!

06:30.122 --> 06:31.111
I'm scared!

06:32.324 --> 06:34.155
Let's go back!

06:34.226 --> 06:35.352
We can't.

06:35.427 --> 06:37.657
Because we haven't
found Cynthia yet.

06:38.864 --> 06:40.092
Cynthia?

06:40.165 --> 06:41.223
This is...

06:41.300 --> 06:42.198
...supposed to be...

06:42.268 --> 06:48.264
...a tour to spend wanton, lustful
days with Taro-sama, isn't it?

06:49.708 --> 06:51.175
You three.

06:52.444 --> 06:55.208
That you're my
staff disgusts me!

06:55.281 --> 06:57.875
Really,
they're totally unbelievable!

06:58.717 --> 07:01.379
This is all to destroy
the underground...

07:01.453 --> 07:05.219
...evil secret society that's
planning to take over Japan!

07:06.625 --> 07:08.320
No, no, that's not it.

07:08.394 --> 07:12.296
It's to excavate legendary,
super ancient weapons...

07:12.364 --> 07:14.332
...sealed at
the bottom of the earth.

07:15.200 --> 07:18.033
I said it's to look for Cynthia...

07:18.103 --> 07:21.800
If you're here to have fun,
go back immediately.

07:21.874 --> 07:23.501
To have fun?

07:23.575 --> 07:27.944
I told you from the start that
I joined because it looked fun.

07:28.013 --> 07:31.608
Honestly, that's why
top dogs are so difficult.

07:31.684 --> 07:34.881
They don't get the nuances
of people on the floor.

07:35.788 --> 07:38.018
Don't show defiance so proudly!

07:38.090 --> 07:39.751
N-Now, now, Konoe-san.

07:39.825 --> 07:42.453
I'm sure they're both just kidding.

07:43.195 --> 07:46.164
I heard heartfelt
sincerity from them.

07:46.231 --> 07:47.994
To tell the truth, me too...

07:48.067 --> 07:49.227
Enough.

07:49.301 --> 07:53.169
We'll be too late if something
truly were to happen...

07:53.238 --> 07:55.069
Exactly!

07:55.140 --> 07:57.301
Well, shall we go, too?

08:06.285 --> 08:09.049
We can see
without light, surprisingly.

08:09.121 --> 08:09.985
You're right...

08:12.324 --> 08:13.459
I'm done this time...

08:13.459 --> 08:13.726
I give up
I'm done this time...

08:13.726 --> 08:15.127
I give up
I can't walk anymore.

08:15.127 --> 08:15.327
No more
I can't walk anymore.

08:15.327 --> 08:16.589
No more
I've reached my limit...

08:16.662 --> 08:19.187
Really, you guys!

08:19.264 --> 08:21.459
But we came pretty far.

08:21.533 --> 08:23.763
It's about time
to take a break, isn't it?

08:23.836 --> 08:25.428
Taro-sama.

08:26.505 --> 08:29.099
All right, let's take
a break for a while.

08:29.174 --> 08:30.471
Yeah.

08:30.542 --> 08:32.840
For Taro-sama's sake.

08:32.911 --> 08:34.902
Understood?
Just ten minutes.

08:34.980 --> 08:35.878
Huh?

08:35.948 --> 08:39.748
Odd, they were just
there trying to get their way.

08:39.818 --> 08:42.286
Maybe they went to the restroom.

08:45.424 --> 08:48.120
Then I'll go take a look around.

08:48.193 --> 08:50.024
Oh, could it be you also...

08:50.095 --> 08:51.153
N-No!

08:51.230 --> 08:52.822
I will come with you.

08:52.898 --> 08:53.796
What?

08:54.533 --> 08:56.057
Is something wrong?

08:56.902 --> 08:59.097
Then let's go, Yashima-san.

08:59.171 --> 09:01.867
Okay, good luck!

09:01.940 --> 09:03.703
Spank, spank. Fool, fool.

09:05.844 --> 09:06.674
What?

09:06.745 --> 09:08.645
No! No, no, no!

09:08.714 --> 09:10.409
I can't go back now!

09:11.884 --> 09:13.283
Oh, it's closed...

09:18.056 --> 09:20.422
Why is there such a thing...

09:20.492 --> 09:25.191
Taro-sama, I think this
may be a trap for intruders.

09:25.264 --> 09:27.391
Then Mariel and the others...

09:28.467 --> 09:31.334
Mariel! Everyone!
Are you all right?

09:31.403 --> 09:32.768
Answer if you can hear me!

09:35.441 --> 09:37.238
What was that just now?

09:37.309 --> 09:38.241
Mariel!

09:38.377 --> 09:39.435
Mariel!

09:39.511 --> 09:41.445
Please calm down, Taro-sama.

09:41.513 --> 09:45.279
It's all right.
Mariel is with Yashima.

09:49.354 --> 09:50.150
Yeah.

09:51.523 --> 09:52.615
Taro-sama...

09:53.692 --> 09:56.456
We don't know
what will happen to us!

09:56.528 --> 09:59.122
Be sure not to take
any careless actions!

09:59.198 --> 10:01.792
I already know that.

10:01.867 --> 10:03.198
I'm not Taro.

10:03.268 --> 10:05.327
There's no way I can goof up.

10:08.907 --> 10:11.603
Wow, that's an old trick.

10:11.677 --> 10:12.803
My goodness.

10:14.746 --> 10:16.771
T-Taro-sama...

10:17.449 --> 10:20.282
My, there are so
many dumb traps.

10:20.352 --> 10:24.015
Really, it's like a glimpse
of the creator's unoriginality.

10:24.089 --> 10:25.556
How about this?

10:25.624 --> 10:27.216
Come on if you dare!

10:34.066 --> 10:35.465
- Taro-sama!
- Taro-sama!

10:40.772 --> 10:41.431
Ah!

10:45.611 --> 10:48.341
Oh, here's a floor cloth!

10:48.413 --> 10:50.847
Wipe it quickly,
or you'll catch a cold.

10:53.986 --> 10:56.614
Anyway, we need
to go forward now.

10:56.688 --> 10:58.053
Come, Taro-sama.

10:58.123 --> 10:59.454
Yeah, you're right.

11:00.726 --> 11:02.489
Let's go. Don't fall behind.

11:02.561 --> 11:03.892
- Right...
- Right...

11:05.998 --> 11:07.431
Don't touch it!

11:07.499 --> 11:10.491
It must be another
worthless trap!

11:10.569 --> 11:11.934
Do not touch it at all!

11:12.004 --> 11:14.837
But this is a piñata.

11:14.907 --> 11:16.431
It is a piñata.

11:16.508 --> 11:19.671
Piñatas are for
happy events, aren't they?

11:19.745 --> 11:22.942
Yes, they're rather
good objects of luck.

11:23.015 --> 11:25.381
I think it's all right this time.

11:25.450 --> 11:27.350
That wall may lift up...

11:27.419 --> 11:28.545
Shall I pull it?

11:28.620 --> 11:29.644
As I said...

11:43.135 --> 11:46.438
Consolation Prize

11:46.438 --> 11:47.530
Consolation Prize
Taro.

11:48.240 --> 11:50.800
Now is not the time to stop.

11:50.876 --> 11:53.970
Let's take up our lost
friend's will and go forward!

11:54.046 --> 11:57.641
We must pass her life story
on to future generations!

12:02.020 --> 12:06.889
Hanaukyo Maid Team

12:11.163 --> 12:12.892
T-This place...

12:24.276 --> 12:25.641
That was Yashima!

12:32.084 --> 12:33.574
S-Silly me...

12:33.652 --> 12:34.414
Leader!

12:35.120 --> 12:36.052
Leader!

12:37.756 --> 12:38.984
Leader?

12:39.057 --> 12:40.319
Silly me...

12:42.094 --> 12:43.322
It's coming!

12:43.395 --> 12:45.829
Leader, please run away!

12:45.897 --> 12:46.921
Yashima!

12:59.544 --> 13:01.637
This happens often, right?

13:01.713 --> 13:03.977
These underpass traps
happen often, right?

13:04.049 --> 13:06.483
It's your fault in the first place!

13:06.551 --> 13:08.451
B-But...

13:11.056 --> 13:14.719
That was there as if
it was asking me to push it!

13:14.793 --> 13:17.421
Self-destruction is
a scientist's romance!

13:17.496 --> 13:18.690
That's a marron!

13:18.764 --> 13:20.732
I like marrons a lot, too!

13:20.799 --> 13:23.233
T-That isn't the point...

13:23.301 --> 13:26.896
All right, I'll take
responsibility and do something!

13:27.773 --> 13:30.105
I'm turning more than usual!

13:30.175 --> 13:31.437
- Just hurry!
- Just hurry!

13:31.510 --> 13:32.943
Ta-dah!

13:33.011 --> 13:37.277
Embezzling expenses bit by bit,
I created the tech staff robot.

13:37.349 --> 13:39.340
Come here!

13:42.921 --> 13:44.411
I'm sorry!

13:44.489 --> 13:46.753
We're out of range here!

13:46.825 --> 13:49.817
Honestly, every one
of you is useless!

13:49.895 --> 13:51.328
Then I'll do it...

13:52.931 --> 13:54.330
Ta-dah!

13:55.634 --> 13:57.625
Eye for eye.
Sword for sword.

13:57.703 --> 13:59.637
And bomb for bomb!

13:59.705 --> 14:00.637
You can't!

14:00.706 --> 14:02.333
You can't do that, can you?

14:19.391 --> 14:21.382
Dog...

14:21.460 --> 14:22.392
No...

14:22.661 --> 14:23.559
No...

14:25.831 --> 14:27.696
She's funny, isn't she?

14:27.766 --> 14:30.030
The big girl fell asleep!

14:31.803 --> 14:34.829
Oh, he's so cute!

14:43.515 --> 14:44.914
Hey, why?

14:44.983 --> 14:47.110
Are all the wealthy like this?

14:47.185 --> 14:50.621
Why is there a place like
this under the mansion?

14:50.689 --> 14:52.122
I don't know!

14:52.190 --> 14:55.387
Don't associate the Jihioh
family with the Hanaukyo family!

14:56.561 --> 14:58.426
I-It might be my limit...

14:58.497 --> 15:00.795
Are you all right, Taro-sama?

15:00.866 --> 15:04.427
Um, Taro-sama seems to be
in pain, so please fall by yourself.

15:04.503 --> 15:07.438
How can you say such
brutal things so calmly?

15:07.506 --> 15:08.837
Absolutely not!

15:09.875 --> 15:11.502
You don't understand.

15:11.576 --> 15:14.807
I'm not asking you.
I'm ordering you!

15:14.880 --> 15:17.041
There... There...

15:17.115 --> 15:19.413
Back and forth,
back and forth...

15:19.484 --> 15:21.281
- There. There.
- Hey, stop!

15:24.589 --> 15:29.322
Thinking the Jihioh family's fate
is in my hands makes me shiver.

15:29.394 --> 15:32.124
Y-You're seriously twisted!

15:36.368 --> 15:38.461
I won't forgive you anymore!

15:38.537 --> 15:40.164
W-What are you doing?

15:40.238 --> 15:44.265
The sin of trampling on the Jihioh
family's head deserves death!

15:44.342 --> 15:47.607
I will personally repay
you a million times over.

15:47.679 --> 15:49.271
Please stop!

15:49.347 --> 15:52.180
Hatred only breeds more hatred!

15:52.250 --> 15:54.775
How dare you say such a thing!

15:54.853 --> 15:56.343
- Not good.
- This mouth!

15:56.421 --> 15:57.979
It's from this mouth!

15:58.056 --> 15:59.887
You stupid girl! Take this!

16:03.495 --> 16:05.190
Ryuka-san!

16:05.263 --> 16:06.787
Ikuyo-chan!

16:07.499 --> 16:10.229
Ryuka-san and Ikuyo-chan, too...

16:10.302 --> 16:12.429
It's all because I'm a coward...

16:12.504 --> 16:14.096
I'm sorry, everyone.

16:14.172 --> 16:15.764
I'm sorry, Mariel.

16:15.841 --> 16:17.365
Did you call me?

16:18.109 --> 16:19.770
Rock climbing?

16:19.845 --> 16:21.540
It looks fun.

16:21.613 --> 16:22.602
Mariel?

16:24.015 --> 16:25.277
Cynthia!

16:25.350 --> 16:27.614
I just made some tea.

16:27.686 --> 16:29.278
Why don't you take a break?

16:29.354 --> 16:31.379
Please join us!

16:31.456 --> 16:32.252
Oh!

16:35.160 --> 16:36.092
Sure...

16:36.928 --> 16:37.758
Woof?

16:42.868 --> 16:44.495
Isn't that a dog?

16:45.403 --> 16:46.927
It is a dog.

16:48.273 --> 16:50.434
I wonder what's next?

16:50.508 --> 16:53.238
Well, the same pattern,
I'm sure...

16:56.114 --> 16:59.242
- I knew it!
- I knew it!

17:01.887 --> 17:05.254
So in that accidentally
discovered room, Cynthia was...

17:06.024 --> 17:08.959
Yes, she was keeping
an abandoned puppy.

17:09.895 --> 17:13.592
Since this morning's
earthquake covered the entrance...

17:13.665 --> 17:15.724
...she couldn't
come back, it seems.

17:15.800 --> 17:16.732
I see.

17:20.505 --> 17:23.065
You thought I'd be
against keeping him, huh?

17:26.177 --> 17:29.874
Let's raise him in the sun
with us all from now on.

17:29.948 --> 17:32.246
So don't make us worry anymore.

17:32.317 --> 17:33.477
All right?

17:45.463 --> 17:46.327
It's me.

17:46.398 --> 17:47.330
What?

17:51.303 --> 17:53.271
A giant building?

17:53.338 --> 17:56.239
Yes, our survey found it...

17:56.308 --> 17:58.469
...in the deepest part
of that underground area.

17:58.543 --> 18:02.070
Also, we've completed
the whole chart of the area.

18:02.147 --> 18:03.375
However...

18:03.448 --> 18:05.177
What?

18:05.250 --> 18:07.684
It may be groundless suspicion.

18:07.752 --> 18:11.586
But for a hidden object,
its discovery was too easy.

18:11.656 --> 18:12.884
As if...

18:12.958 --> 18:16.860
...it were asking
to be discovered, correct?

18:16.928 --> 18:18.156
Y-Yes.

18:26.972 --> 18:30.874
He got completely used to this
place in just one day, didn't he?

18:30.942 --> 18:34.844
Everyone in the mansion
has welcomed Fenrir-chan, too.

18:34.913 --> 18:36.346
Fenrir?

18:36.414 --> 18:38.939
Yes, it's his name.

18:39.617 --> 18:42.484
I heard it's
the name of a monster...

18:42.554 --> 18:45.955
...that appears at Ragnarok and
turns the world into a ball of fire.

19:17.956 --> 19:19.856
Everyone, stand by
where you are.

19:55.427 --> 19:57.190
Sorry, are you all right?

20:03.268 --> 20:04.394
Mariel?

20:11.743 --> 20:12.675
Huh?

20:15.380 --> 20:16.312
Mari...

20:42.340 --> 20:43.398
Taro-sama.

20:45.577 --> 20:47.340
Shall we head back soon?

20:50.515 --> 20:51.447
Yeah...

21:02.961 --> 21:04.087
It's me!

21:04.162 --> 21:07.962
As of now, we are sealing
the underground area completely.

21:08.032 --> 21:12.526
Seal this area and process its
data as a special level A secret.

21:12.604 --> 21:13.536
Hurry!

21:46.304 --> 21:49.603
Please leave everything to us.

21:49.674 --> 21:51.801
Hanaukyo Maid Team.

21:52.877 --> 21:56.005
We're going to take care of you.

21:56.080 --> 21:59.174
Your private personal team.

21:59.250 --> 22:02.344
Always to match your taste.

22:02.420 --> 22:04.615
We're highly motivated.

22:05.690 --> 22:08.853
We polish our minds and bodies.

22:08.927 --> 22:11.862
Tell us anything.

22:11.930 --> 22:23.432
Just want you to be
pleased, to be pleased.

22:24.576 --> 22:35.180
But, but,
what a cold-hearted man.

22:37.455 --> 22:43.553
Look, the stars are beautiful.

22:43.628 --> 22:49.225
Tomorrow sure
will be sunny, too.

22:50.268 --> 22:56.571
Tonight too, in your dream too...

22:56.641 --> 23:00.941
...we serve you.

23:10.989 --> 23:13.457
I don't see cars on
the Hanaukyo grounds.

23:13.524 --> 23:15.651
We use helicopters to travel...

23:15.727 --> 23:17.752
The fuel costs must be high!

23:17.829 --> 23:19.998
Episode 8,
Woman in a Sports Car.

23:19.998 --> 23:20.431
Next Episode
Woman in a Sports Car
Episode 8,
Woman in a Sports Car.

23:20.431 --> 23:23.167
Next Episode
Woman in a Sports Car
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:23.167 --> 23:24.896
Next Episode
Woman in a Sports Car
